<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.1.3">
<l>naṉmai tīmaika ḷoṉṟuma ṟiyēṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">nāra ṇāveṉṉu mittaṉai yallāl</l>
<l>puṉmai yāluṉṉaip puḷḷuvam pēcip</l>
<l rend="indent">pukaḻvā ṉaṉṟukaṇ ṭāytiru mālē</l>
<l>yuṉṉu māṟuṉṉai yoṉṟuma ṟiyēṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">ōvā tēnamō nāraṇā veṉpaṉ</l>
<l>vaṉmai yāvatuṉ kōyilil vāḻum</l>
<l rend="indent">vaiṭṭa ṇavaṉeṉṉum vaṉmaikaṇ ṭāyē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>I know nothing of goodness or evils,</l>
<l rend="indent">except this much - to say “Nāraṇā.”</l>
<l>Tirumāl, [this] is not spoken meanly,</l>
<l rend="indent">deceitfully [just] to flatter [you], you see.</l>
<l>I know no way to think of you.</l>
<l rend="indent">[So] I say “Namo Nāraṇa” incessantly.</l>
<l>Strength, you see, is the strength of the Vaiṣṇava</l>
<l rend="indent">who lives in your temple.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
